WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:30.400 --> 01:32.400
Nerv Headquarters - Test Facility 2

01:32.440 --> 01:34.110
22 Days Ago

01:33.140 --> 01:34.920
Commence activation.

01:34.920 --> 01:36.790
Connecting main power to all circuits.

01:36.790 --> 01:40.070
Main power supply connected.
Commencing activation system.

01:43.490 --> 01:48.740
Activation voltage is approaching
critical level. 0.5, 0.2. Rising.

01:48.740 --> 01:51.040
Begin the second phase
of the activation system.

01:51.040 --> 01:53.010
Pilot has begun link-up.

01:53.010 --> 01:54.720
Start system Phase 2.

01:56.590 --> 01:58.950
Synapses inserted. Junctions connecting.

01:58.950 --> 02:00.220
Transmitting pulse.

02:00.220 --> 02:01.820
All circuits are operational.

02:01.820 --> 02:03.890
No problems with initial contact.

02:03.890 --> 02:06.630
Power supplied to brachial muscles
in both arms.

02:07.900 --> 02:09.830
All nerve links checking out normal.

02:09.830 --> 02:12.270
Check list satisfactory up to 2550.

02:12.270 --> 02:13.560
Prepare for third stage connection.

02:13.560 --> 02:15.860
Clear up to 2580.

02:15.860 --> 02:18.100
Counting down to the absolute borderline.

02:18.100 --> 02:19.430
0.9...

02:19.430 --> 02:20.640
0.7...

02:20.640 --> 02:21.970
0.5...

02:21.970 --> 02:23.240
0.4...

02:23.240 --> 02:24.510
0.3...

02:24.510 --> 02:25.990
The pulses are flowing backward!

02:28.040 --> 02:29.860
Something's going wrong in the third stage!

02:30.760 --> 02:33.130
Rejection occurring in the
nerve center elements!

02:35.960 --> 02:39.190
Cease contact! Break all circuits
through number six!

02:39.190 --> 02:41.500
I can't! The signal's not being received!

02:53.820 --> 02:56.140
Unit 00 is out of control!

02:56.140 --> 02:58.540
Abort the experiment.
Shut off the power supply.

02:58.540 --> 02:59.650
Yes, Sir!

03:08.410 --> 03:10.550
Unit 00 has switched to backup power!

03:10.550 --> 03:12.540
Thirty-five seconds until it comes
to a complete stop.

03:22.380 --> 03:23.550
It's dangerous! Please get back!

03:26.280 --> 03:28.270
Auto ejection activating!

03:28.270 --> 03:28.560
No!

03:34.620 --> 03:35.680
Complete shutdown in ten seconds. 9...

03:35.680 --> 03:37.380
Use the special Bakelite! Hurry!
Complete shutdown in ten seconds. 9...

03:37.380 --> 03:37.550
Use the special Bakelite! Hurry!
8...

03:37.550 --> 03:38.350
8...

03:38.350 --> 03:39.280
7...

03:39.280 --> 03:39.410
Rei!
7...

03:39.410 --> 03:39.810
Rei!
6...

03:39.810 --> 03:40.650
6...

03:40.650 --> 03:41.740
5...

03:41.740 --> 03:42.820
4...

03:42.820 --> 03:43.850
3...

03:43.850 --> 03:44.950
2...

03:44.950 --> 03:45.780
1...

03:45.780 --> 03:46.630
Zero!

04:04.150 --> 04:06.220
Rei, are you all right?

04:07.260 --> 04:08.960
Rei!

04:12.260 --> 04:12.980
I see.

04:19.190 --> 04:22.150
EPISODE FIVE
REI, BEYOND THE HEART

04:24.710 --> 04:26.960
Rei Ayanami, age fourteen.

04:26.960 --> 04:30.600
The first test subject chosen in
accordance with the Marduk Report.

04:30.600 --> 04:32.600
The First Child.

04:32.600 --> 04:36.280
She is the designated pilot for
Evangelion prototype Unit 00.

04:37.090 --> 04:40.880
Her past has been eradicated. All her
personal records were erased.

04:40.880 --> 04:44.080
So, what caused the accident during
the last experiment?

04:44.080 --> 04:45.550
We still don't know.

04:45.550 --> 04:51.450
However, we believe that mental instability
on the part of the pilot was a primary cause.

04:51.450 --> 04:54.320
Mental instability? In Rei?

04:54.320 --> 04:58.430
Yes, her mind became much more disturbed
than we had anticipated.

04:58.430 --> 04:59.560
So what happened?

04:59.560 --> 05:00.810
I don't know.

05:01.810 --> 05:04.000
But could it be...

05:04.000 --> 05:05.930
Did something occur to you?

05:05.930 --> 05:09.150
No, that can't be it.

05:33.480 --> 05:36.240
So this is our enemy.

05:41.150 --> 05:45.710
I see. Most everything except the core
remains intact.

05:45.710 --> 05:48.280
This is an ideal sample.

05:48.280 --> 05:49.340
I appreciate it!

05:49.340 --> 05:51.830
So, did you find anything new?

05:54.700 --> 05:56.180
What the heck is this?

05:56.180 --> 05:58.990
That's the code number for
"cannot be analyzed".

05:58.990 --> 06:01.260
You mean, you don't know
what the heck it is?

06:01.260 --> 06:05.160
Correct. We do know the Angel is
composed of a type of matter

06:05.160 --> 06:08.010
characterized by both particulate and
wave properties, like light.

06:10.380 --> 06:13.740
But you've at least found its power source,
haven't you?

06:13.740 --> 06:15.540
Something like that anyway.

06:15.540 --> 06:18.610
But we haven't been able to figure out
any of its operating principles.

06:18.610 --> 06:21.840
Well, I guess there's still a whole world
of things we don't know about yet.

06:21.840 --> 06:24.350
The world is filled with mysteries.

06:24.350 --> 06:26.280
For example, take a look at this.

06:26.280 --> 06:28.870
This is the Angel's inherent wave pattern.

06:30.470 --> 06:31.240
What? Let me see.

06:34.470 --> 06:35.720
Could this be...

06:35.720 --> 06:38.830
Yes. Although they are composed
of a different form of matter,

06:38.830 --> 06:41.900
their actual composition,
in terms of the arrangement

06:41.900 --> 06:45.800
and spacing of the pattern, falls within
a 99.89% match of human genes.

06:45.800 --> 06:48.740
99.89%?

06:48.740 --> 06:50.910
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

06:50.910 --> 06:52.910
Bring it down... slowly...
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

06:52.910 --> 06:53.240
Okay!
It really shows us just how limited
our level of understanding is.

06:53.240 --> 06:53.710
Okay!

06:53.710 --> 06:56.040
That's good. Stop.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.610
This is the core?

06:57.610 --> 06:58.780
How's the rest of it?

06:58.780 --> 07:02.780
It's pretty deteriorated. We can't expect
to use it as a reference.

07:02.780 --> 07:04.650
That's not a problem.
Dispose of the remnants.

07:04.650 --> 07:06.420
Yes, Sir.

07:06.420 --> 07:07.760
What's wrong?

07:07.760 --> 07:10.570
Well, nothing's wrong.

07:11.610 --> 07:16.000
Are you aware that when you say
"nothing" that way,

07:16.000 --> 07:20.580
it's the same as asking others
to pay attention to you?

07:23.520 --> 07:28.580
Well, it's just that my father seems
to have burned his hands.

07:28.580 --> 07:29.710
Burned?

07:31.030 --> 07:33.380
I was just wondering how it happened.

07:33.380 --> 07:36.680
Burns? Do you know?

07:36.680 --> 07:38.850
It was before you arrived at Nerv.

07:38.850 --> 07:42.290
Unit 00 went berserk during
the activation experiments.

07:42.290 --> 07:43.630
You've heard about that, right?

07:43.630 --> 07:45.030
Yes.

07:45.030 --> 07:48.960
The pilot was trapped inside.

07:48.960 --> 07:51.900
The pilot? You mean Ayanami, right?

07:51.900 --> 07:54.670
It was Commander Ikari who rescued her.

07:54.670 --> 07:58.510
He opened the super-heated hatch
with his bare hands.

07:58.510 --> 08:00.180
My father did that?

08:01.420 --> 08:03.870
That's how he burned his hands.

08:07.560 --> 08:08.780
Go, Hideko!

08:08.780 --> 08:10.450
Come on, lose!

08:10.450 --> 08:13.490
You've got to treat us to pizza if you lose!

08:13.490 --> 08:14.920
There, go for it!

08:14.920 --> 08:16.100
You won't make it!

08:18.310 --> 08:19.760
Now, let's sink a shot!

08:22.040 --> 08:23.330
Oh my gosh! Those guys are looking at us!

08:23.330 --> 08:25.930
Perverts!
Oh my gosh! Those guys are looking at us!

08:25.930 --> 08:28.850
Man, they've all got such incredible breasts.

08:29.570 --> 08:32.810
Suzuhara's ogling us! Gross!

08:32.810 --> 08:33.510
Hi, Shinji!
Suzuhara's ogling us! Gross!

08:33.510 --> 08:34.490
Hi, Shinji!

08:35.690 --> 08:37.580
Hey, Chief!

08:37.580 --> 08:39.750
What're you lookin' at so intently?

08:39.750 --> 08:40.850
Nothing!

08:40.850 --> 08:42.850
Was it Ayanami? Am I right?

08:42.850 --> 08:44.520
No!

08:44.520 --> 08:48.460
Oh, come on. That's suspicious...

08:48.460 --> 08:50.160
Ayanami's boobs...

08:50.160 --> 08:51.990
Ayanami's thighs...

08:51.990 --> 08:53.050
Ayanami's...

08:53.220 --> 08:55.430
...calves!

08:55.430 --> 08:57.270
I told you, it's nothing like that.

08:57.270 --> 08:59.000
Then, what were you looking at?

08:59.000 --> 09:00.780
You can't fool me.

09:03.380 --> 09:07.250
I was just wondering why she's always alone.

09:08.690 --> 09:11.150
Come to think of it,

09:11.150 --> 09:14.580
she hasn't had any friends since
she started here in the seventh grade.

09:14.580 --> 09:17.750
There's just something about her that
makes her hard to approach.

09:17.750 --> 09:20.500
She's probably just got a lousy personality.

09:23.840 --> 09:28.530
You're both Eva pilots, right?
You should know her better than us.

09:28.530 --> 09:30.200
He's right.

09:30.200 --> 09:33.880
Well, I've hardly spoken to her.

09:34.820 --> 09:37.910
Eva Unit 01 is now entering
the third stage cooling process.

09:37.910 --> 09:42.310
Lower all systems to Phase 3 in Cage 6.

09:42.310 --> 09:45.510
The earlier harmonics and
synchronization tests were good.

09:45.510 --> 09:47.120
All numerical conditions
have been satisfied.

09:47.120 --> 09:49.920
Roger. Transmit the results to Balthazar.

09:49.920 --> 09:51.220
Roger.

09:51.220 --> 09:55.760
Transmit the full range of the entry plug's
personal data to Melchior.

09:55.760 --> 09:57.450
Data transmitting.

09:57.450 --> 09:59.860
This is Melchior, roger. Circuits connected.

09:59.860 --> 10:02.080
Initiating third stage cooling process.

10:02.080 --> 10:04.470
CBL circulation has begun.

10:04.470 --> 10:06.730
Condensation reactor,
commencing operation.

10:06.730 --> 10:09.070
Vent waste fluid to the second
purification system.

10:09.070 --> 10:12.470
The protein walls are in good condition.
No problems detected.

10:12.470 --> 10:15.960
T minus 1,050 minutes until the Unit 00
re-activation experiment.

10:18.730 --> 10:20.680
What is this?!

10:20.680 --> 10:22.250
It's curry.

10:22.250 --> 10:24.850
So you're still eating this instant stuff.

10:24.850 --> 10:27.500
Look, you're a guest, so you've got
no right to complain.

10:29.570 --> 10:31.590
What about you, Miss Misato?

10:31.590 --> 10:32.880
For me...

10:32.150 --> 10:33.820
Super Cup



Green Onion Roast Pork

10:34.080 --> 10:38.930
Ta-da! Just pour it right in here!

10:38.930 --> 10:40.500
Are you serious?

10:40.500 --> 10:43.300
Oh, don't you know how good this is?

10:43.300 --> 10:44.170
Okay...

10:44.170 --> 10:48.700
Ordinary curry flavored instant ramen
can't compare to this!

10:49.760 --> 10:52.010
Let's eat!

10:52.010 --> 10:55.130
The trick is to put less hot water in the soup.

11:01.270 --> 11:03.490
Misato cooked this, didn't she?

11:03.490 --> 11:04.060
Yes.
Misato cooked this, didn't she?

11:04.060 --> 11:05.390
Yes.
Oh, can you tell?

11:05.390 --> 11:06.230
Oh, can you tell?

11:06.230 --> 11:07.360
Yes, by its taste.

11:07.360 --> 11:10.160
How can she make something
ready-to-eat taste so awful?

11:10.160 --> 11:14.620
Next time, invite me when
it's Shinji's turn to cook.

11:34.240 --> 11:36.790
Shinji, you really ought to move out.

11:36.790 --> 11:41.010
You shouldn't let one bad roommate
ruin your life.

11:41.010 --> 11:42.740
I'm used to it now.

11:42.740 --> 11:44.800
He's right, Ritsuko.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.600
Never underestimate the ability
of the human animal

11:46.600 --> 11:48.900
to adapt to its environment.

11:48.900 --> 11:51.370
And anyway, if he does move...

11:51.370 --> 11:53.780
Shinji, can you bring me
another one, please?

11:53.780 --> 11:54.810
Right.

11:54.810 --> 11:56.610
The red tape would be a pain.

11:56.610 --> 11:59.950
He just got his permanent security card,
you know.

11:59.950 --> 12:02.120
Oh, I almost forgot!

12:02.120 --> 12:04.250
Shinji, would you do me a favor?

12:04.250 --> 12:05.650
What is it?

12:05.650 --> 12:07.500
Rei Ayanami's renewal card.

12:08.370 --> 12:10.660
I keep forgetting to give this to her.

12:10.660 --> 12:15.830
Would you mind delivering it
before you go to headquarters?

12:15.830 --> 12:16.670
Sure.

12:23.020 --> 12:26.810
What's the matter?
You're staring at Rei's picture.

12:26.810 --> 12:28.540
Nothing!

12:28.540 --> 12:30.580
Shinji, don't tell me...

12:30.580 --> 12:31.810
No!

12:31.810 --> 12:35.350
Oh, come on! You're blushing!

12:35.350 --> 12:37.590
Well, you've got an official excuse
to go to Rei's place now.

12:37.590 --> 12:38.650
This is your chance, isn't it?

12:40.400 --> 12:42.400
Stop teasing me!

12:43.810 --> 12:46.690
But I love teasing you.
You always take it so seriously!

12:46.690 --> 12:48.830
Just like Misato.

12:48.830 --> 12:52.030
I just find it strange that I know
so little about Ayanami,

12:52.030 --> 12:54.240
even though we're both Eva pilots.

12:54.240 --> 12:57.640
She's a very nice girl,
but she's like your father.

12:57.640 --> 12:59.870
She's not very adept.

12:59.870 --> 13:01.550
Not adept at what?

13:03.190 --> 13:04.470
Living.

13:22.940 --> 13:25.070
Ayanami

13:41.660 --> 13:43.300
Excuse me?

13:46.930 --> 13:49.870
Excuse me, it's Ikari.

13:51.670 --> 13:53.440
I'm coming in, Ayanami!

14:31.050 --> 14:32.550
Are these hers?

14:46.230 --> 14:48.530
Well...

14:51.740 --> 14:53.430
I didn't mean...

15:29.770 --> 15:31.070
Do you mind moving?

15:35.140 --> 15:36.850
I...

15:54.860 --> 15:56.450
What is it?

15:56.450 --> 16:00.770
Well, I mean, I was...

16:04.370 --> 16:09.300
I was asked to, so...

16:09.300 --> 16:11.530
What was it? The card, your card...

16:11.530 --> 16:13.630
It's been renewed!

16:13.630 --> 16:15.480
I was asked to deliver it.

16:17.920 --> 16:22.080
So... So, I didn't mean
for any of this to happen.

16:28.500 --> 16:31.430
Miss Ritsuko said she forgot to give it to you.

16:32.400 --> 16:36.120
It's true. I rang your bell,
but there was no reply,

16:36.120 --> 16:39.040
and the door was unlocked. So...

16:58.290 --> 17:02.380
<i>Central Dogma is currently
open to the public.</i>

17:02.380 --> 17:04.900
<i>Group 3 should proceed directly
to the fourth gate.</i>

17:08.130 --> 17:12.210
This is your new card. Miss Ritsuko
asked me to deliver it to you.

17:19.850 --> 17:21.800
I'm sorry about earlier.

17:21.800 --> 17:23.390
About what?

17:26.850 --> 17:30.360
You have a re-activation experiment
today, don't you?

17:31.860 --> 17:34.230
Wouldn't it be great if it were
successful this time?

17:37.770 --> 17:44.730
Say, aren't you afraid of getting in
Unit 00 again?

17:44.730 --> 17:46.310
Why?

17:48.610 --> 17:52.330
I heard that you were hurt pretty badly
in an earlier experiment,

17:52.330 --> 17:54.550
so I was wondering if you were okay about it.

17:57.550 --> 18:00.840
Aren't you Commander Ikari's son?

18:00.840 --> 18:01.810
Yeah.

18:01.810 --> 18:05.450
Don't you have faith in your
own father's work?

18:05.450 --> 18:08.020
Of course not! How could I trust him?

18:11.830 --> 18:12.520
What?

18:32.590 --> 18:35.540
Rei, are you all right?

18:35.540 --> 18:37.130
Rei...

18:38.960 --> 18:42.780
The pilot was trapped inside.

18:42.780 --> 18:45.720
It was Commander Ikari who rescued her.

18:45.720 --> 18:49.090
He opened the super-heated hatch
with his bare hands.

18:49.090 --> 18:51.340
That's how he burned his hands.

19:00.250 --> 19:01.640
Rei.

19:01.640 --> 19:03.000
Can you hear me?

19:03.000 --> 19:04.410
Yes.

19:04.410 --> 19:08.110
We will now commence the Unit 00
re-activation experiment.

19:08.110 --> 19:09.660
First stage connection initiated.

19:11.090 --> 19:13.250
Connecting main power supply.

19:13.250 --> 19:15.580
Activation voltage has passed
the critical point.

19:15.580 --> 19:16.850
Roger.

19:16.850 --> 19:19.170
Shift format to Phase 2.

19:19.170 --> 19:21.390
Connecting pilot to Unit 00.

19:21.390 --> 19:23.100
Opening circuits.

19:25.180 --> 19:27.440
Pulse and harmonics are normal.

19:28.440 --> 19:30.100
No problems detected in synchronization.

19:30.100 --> 19:31.580
All nerve links completed.

19:33.020 --> 19:35.100
Central nervous system
elements are nominal.

19:35.100 --> 19:36.880
Re-calculating, no error corrections.

19:38.290 --> 19:41.150
Checklist is satisfactory up to 2590.

19:41.490 --> 19:43.080
Approaching the absolute borderline.

19:43.080 --> 19:44.550
2.5 more.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.750
1.7...

19:45.750 --> 19:46.850
1.2...

19:46.850 --> 19:48.120
1.0...

19:48.120 --> 19:49.380
0.8...

19:49.380 --> 19:50.580
0.6...

19:50.580 --> 19:51.750
0.5...

19:51.750 --> 19:52.990
0.4...

19:52.990 --> 19:54.190
0.3...

19:54.190 --> 19:55.390
0.2...

19:55.390 --> 19:57.960
0.1, and rising.

19:57.960 --> 20:00.060
Borderline cleared.

20:00.060 --> 20:02.300
Unit 00 has been activated.

20:02.300 --> 20:03.460
Roger.

20:03.460 --> 20:05.830
Beginning interlock test.

20:05.830 --> 20:06.640
Roger.

20:11.590 --> 20:15.710
Ikari, an unidentified flying object
is approaching.

20:15.710 --> 20:17.140
It is likely the fifth Angel.

20:17.140 --> 20:21.480
Stop the test. All personnel,
alert status Level One.

20:21.480 --> 20:24.120
You're not going to use Unit 00?

20:24.120 --> 20:27.250
She's not ready to fight yet.
What's the status on Unit 01?

20:27.250 --> 20:29.560
It'll be ready in 380 seconds.

20:29.560 --> 20:30.560
Engage!

20:30.560 --> 20:31.260
Yes, Sir.

20:31.260 --> 20:32.060
Rei.
Yes, Sir.

20:32.060 --> 20:32.530
Rei.

20:32.530 --> 20:35.270
Re-activation was successful.
Return now.

20:59.730 --> 21:02.020
The target is passing over Tonosawa.

21:02.020 --> 21:04.370
Unit 01 is beginning launch preparations.

21:05.570 --> 21:07.240
Releasing primary lock bolts.

21:09.210 --> 21:10.330
Release confirmed.

21:10.330 --> 21:11.170
Roger.
Release confirmed.

21:11.170 --> 21:11.830
Roger.
Releasing secondary restraints.

21:11.830 --> 21:12.830
Releasing secondary restraints.

21:12.830 --> 21:13.790
Roger.

21:13.790 --> 21:16.500
The target is now intruding into
Lake Ashino airspace.

21:16.500 --> 21:19.410
Eva Unit 01 is ready for launch.

21:19.410 --> 21:20.250
Launch!

21:27.130 --> 21:29.680
We're detecting a high energy reaction
from inside the target!

21:29.680 --> 21:30.720
What?!

21:30.720 --> 21:33.050
The circumference area is accelerating!
It's converging!

21:33.050 --> 21:33.680
It can't be!

21:40.690 --> 21:41.860
No, dodge it!

21:58.460 --> 21:59.460
Shinji!

21:59.500 --> 22:00.710
TO BE CONTINUED

23:06.230 --> 23:07.110
PREVIEW

23:08.070 --> 23:12.220
Shinji is saved, but his injuries
cause him to act spoiled.

23:12.220 --> 23:13.550
Rei pushes him away.

23:13.550 --> 23:17.040
Meanwhile, Misato tries to mount
a pin-point attack on the Angel.

23:17.040 --> 23:21.310
Next Evangelion:
"Decisive Battle, New Tokyo-3"

23:19.120 --> 23:21.250
DECISIVE BATTLE, NEW TOKYO-3
